  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/478ec2fc24777879c829993d19b0d68c.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #7030a0;\">If someone in your audience is struggling with a challenge, send them to us!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>We are a team of holistic psychologists and life coaches who specialize in helping women resolve such common everyday problems </strong>as feeling overwhelmed because &ldquo;everything is on you and there is no end in sight&rdquo; &ndash; or feeling stuck and not being able to figure out life&rsquo;s direction; anything from learning to parent better and ending fights with the kids &ndash; to better managing relationships and ending fights with the husband, and so on.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">A holistic approach suggests overall natural solutions for both the physical and the emotional side of us. This is what you will see on our site as well. Although you&rsquo;re welcome to reference any of the products you find on the website (such as Natural Beauty program that teaches natural anti-aging techniques, Natural Anti-diet weight loss, or aromatherapy tools), for this introduction, I want to call your attention to the collection of our 5 day live online workshops and short coaching modules.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #7030a0;\">There are many life-coaching services around. However, when it comes to the following points, the market is pretty much limited just to us:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We tackle the problems that are commonly written off as having no solutions:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle; margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 96px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Feeling guilty when trying to balance building a career or a new business and being pregnant or nursing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 1in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle; margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 96px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Not seeing one&rsquo;s value when being a stay home mom</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle; margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 96px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Dealing with an un-appreciative partner and/or a toxic relationship on top of motherhood</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle; margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 96px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Getting the kids to listen</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle; margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 96px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Stopping put-downs and verbal abuse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle; margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 96px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Keeping your head straight despite the raging post-partum hormones and lack of sleep</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 1in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><em>&hellip; to name just a few</em></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We focus on helping women specifically &ndash; and address the specific challenges of motherhood</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The trend of seeing value in help form a holistic psychologist is rising &ndash; but science based holistic coaching is hard to find: most holistic therapies are spirituality based</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We use the approach of bioenergetics, which is very popular in Europe, but new to the United States. People learn a lot of new information and find the approach very entertaining and engaging.</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We focus on results, as opposed to an opportunity to simply talk things out</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We provide value by allowing the workshop participants to both closely work with the therapist and network with each other, finding friends and sharing one&rsquo;s life experiences</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We use an asynchronous method which does not require attending sessions at any specific time, and thus can welcome the audience world-wide (refer to the description on any workshop for the details on how this works)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Although some workshop titles have a more general nature, as I have mentioned, we use them to address problems associated with motherhood, when the intake questionnaire (which every participant fills out prior to the workshop) indicates such a need.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">For example, Brain Fog workshop will address cases of brain fog associated with post-partum, as well as the natural remedies that can be used at that time.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #7030a0;\">The titles of the workshops speak for themselves, so just scan over them here:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #7030a0;\"><a style=\"color: rgb(5, 99, 193); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://triumphovergray.com/collections/live-coaching-sessions-and-programs/products/relationship-dialog-facilitator\">View Coaching Modules</a></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>TERMS:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We pay a generous <strong>30% commission on all</strong> Triumph Over Gray products. (Partner products are excluded) Modules <strong>range from $45 for some 5 day workshops to $1295</strong> for longer modules and private engagements for a single purchase</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Workshops serve as an interest-perking and results-demonstrating introduction into the method, and <strong>about 60% of participants usually end up buying follow up modules</strong> &ndash; usually this will fall <strong>within the 30 day cookie period</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We are very responsive, and <strong>will accommodate custom requests</strong> for discounts, coupons, special offers and so forth. We will also accommodate special requests for specific workshop titles (in other words, <strong>we will create a separate workshop for a particular need/question that you specify</strong>, as long as you feel that there will be at least 10 participants)</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We have a <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCzgHxWGcDqA7z4-YCvvPV-A\"><strong>YouTube channel</strong></a> with videos that give a sneak-peak into the benefits of the method<strong><br><br><br></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>",
